#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/installAgentAssets.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Write pantoken's agent assets for a tool into a consumer repo."
msgstr "Ysgrifennu asedau asiant pantoken ar gyfer teclyn i mewn i repo defnyddiwr."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/installAgentAssets.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A specific [AgentTool](../type-aliases/AgentTool.md), or `\"all\"` for every asset."
msgstr "Teclyn penodol [AgentTool](../type-aliases/AgentTool.md), neu `\"all\"` ar gyfer pob ased."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/installAgentAssets.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The target directory (default `\".\"`)."
msgstr "Y cyfeiriadur targed (diofyn `\".\"`)."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/installAgentAssets.md
#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The paths written."
msgstr "Y llwybrau a ysgrifennwyd."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/installAgentAssets.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Install one tool's assets into a repo**"
msgstr "**Gosod asedau un declyn i mewn i repo**"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/installAgentAssets.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Install every asset into the current directory**"
msgstr "**Gosod pob ased i mewn i'r cyfeiriadur cyfredol**"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/isScaffoldPlatform.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Whether `platform` is a known [ScaffoldPlatform](../type-aliases/ScaffoldPlatform.md) or one of its aliases (e.g. `html`)."
msgstr "P'un a yw `platform` yn [ScaffoldPlatform](../type-aliases/ScaffoldPlatform.md) adnabyddus neu'n un o'i aliasau (er enghraifft `html`)."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Scaffold a starter project for a platform (via `@pantoken/scaffold`), and install pantoken's\nagent assets (via [installAgentAssets](installAgentAssets.md)) into the same directory."
msgstr "Creu prosiect cychwyn ar gyfer llwyfan (trwy `@pantoken/scaffold`), a gosod asedau asiant pantoken (trwy [installAgentAssets](installAgentAssets.md)) i'r un cyfeiriadur."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A [ScaffoldPlatform](../type-aliases/ScaffoldPlatform.md)."
msgstr "Mae'n [ScaffoldPlatform](../type-aliases/ScaffoldPlatform.md)."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The target directory (default `\".\"`). Its basename (or `\"pantoken-app\"` for `\".\"`)\n  is substituted for `{{projectName}}` in the scaffold's template files."
msgstr "Y cyfeiriadur targed (diofyn `\".\"`). Ei enw gwaelod (neu `\"pantoken-app\"` ar gyfer `\".\"`)\n  yn cael ei ddisodli yn lle `{{projectName}}` yn ffeiliau templed y scaffold."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Which agent tool's assets to install alongside the scaffold (default `\"all\"`)."
msgstr "Pa asedau offer asiant i'w gosod gyda'r scaffold (diofyn `\"all\"`)."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The paths written, scaffold files first."
msgstr "Y llwybrau a ysgrifennwyd, ffeiliau'r scaffold yn gyntaf."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldAndInit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Scaffold a React starter with every agent asset installed**"
msgstr "**Creu prosiect cychwyn React gyda phob ased asiant wedi'i osod**"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Scaffold a starter project for a platform, with pantoken already installed and wired in."
msgstr "Creu prosiect cychwyn ar gyfer llwyfan, gyda pantoken eisoes wedi'i osod a'i hintegreiddio."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The target directory (default `\".\"`). Its basename (or `\"pantoken-app\"` for `\".\"`)\n  is substituted for `{{projectName}}` in the template files."
msgstr "Yr cyfeiriadur targed (diofyn `\".\"`). Ei enw sylfaenol (neu `\"pantoken-app\"` ar gyfer `\".\"`)\n  yw'r hyn sy'n cael ei ddisodli am `{{projectName}}` yn y ffeiliau templed."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`theme`/`mode` select which `@pantoken/css` token sheet scaffolded files\n  import (default `\"rebrand\"`/`\"light\"`), applied across every platform. `cdn` selects the CDN\n  provider `canvas-theme-editor`'s `theme.css`/`theme.js` are built for (default jsDelivr);\n  ignored by every other platform. `locale` (default `\"en\"`) sets the generated markup's\n  `lang`/`dir` attributes."
msgstr "`theme`/`mode` dewiswch pa `@pantoken/css` ffeiliau strwythuredig ar gyfer taflen tocynnau\n  mewnforio (diofyn `\"rebrand\"`/`\"light\"`), wedi'u cymhwyso ar draws pob platfform. `cdn` yn dewis y CDN\n  darparwr `canvas-theme-editor` y `theme.css`/`theme.js` wedi'u hadeiladu ar gyfer (diofyn jsDelivr);\n  yn cael eu hanwybyddu gan bob platfform arall. `locale` (diofyn `\"en\"`) yn gosod priodoleddau'r marc-up a gynhyrchir\n  `lang`/`dir` attributes."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Scaffold a React starter**"
msgstr "**Creu dechrau React**"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/ai` — consumer-facing agent assets for projects that *use* pantoken (not for\ndeveloping pantoken itself)."
msgstr "`@pantoken/ai` — asedau asiantaeth sy’n wynebu defnyddwyr ar gyfer prosiectau sy’n *defnyddio* pantoken (nid ar gyfer\nddatblygu pantoken ei hun)."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It ships an `AGENTS.md`, an `llms.txt`, editor/agent rule files (Cursor, Copilot, Windsurf), and\nClaude Code skills (`init-pantoken`, `create-pantoken-app`), plus [installAgentAssets](functions/installAgentAssets.md) /\n[scaffoldAndInit](functions/scaffoldAndInit.md) / the `pantoken-ai` CLI to drop them into a consumer repo at the\nconventional paths."
msgstr "Mae’n cynnwys `AGENTS.md`, `llms.txt`, ffeiliau rheolau golygydd/asiant (Cursor, Copilot, Windsurf), a\nsgiliau Claude Code (`init-pantoken`, `create-pantoken-app`), yn ogystal ag [installAgentAssets](functions/installAgentAssets.md) /\n[scaffoldAndInit](functions/scaffoldAndInit.md) / y CLI `pantoken-ai` i’w bwydo i mewn i repo defnyddiwr ar y\nllwybrau confensiynol."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/type-aliases/AgentTool.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An agent/editor tool pantoken can install assets for."
msgstr "Offeryn asiant/golygydd y gall pantoken osod asedau ar ei gyfer."

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/type-aliases/ScaffoldPlatform.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A platform pantoken can scaffold a starter project for."
msgstr "Platfform y gall pantoken greu prosiect cychwyn ar ei gyfer."

