#: formats/components/src/functions/baseCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the opt-in base/reset stylesheet: global document defaults from the tokens (box-sizing, body\nreset, page surface, base text colour/font, `color-scheme`, base link), followed by the focus-ring\nrules (a document-level default that targets bare focusables). Only the ring *rules* live here — the\n`--instui-focus-outline-*` custom properties they read ship in the token sheet (`@pantoken/css`), so\n`base.css` no longer redefines them. Load it once, ahead of the component and prose sheets, when\npantoken owns the page."
msgstr "Adeiladu taflen arddull sylfaenol/reset dewisol: diofynion dogfen byd-eang o'r tocynau (box-sizing, body\nreset, wyneb tudalen, lliw/ffont testun sylfaen, `color-scheme`, dolen sylfaen), ac yna'r rheolau cylchffocws\n(rhaiad diofyn ar lefel y ddogfen sy'n targedu elfennau sy'n derbyn ffocws heb addurn). Dim ond y *rheolau* cylch sydd yma —\nmae'r eiddo personol `--instui-focus-outline-*` a ddarllenant yn cael eu cyflwyno yn y daflen tocyn (`@pantoken/css`), felly\n`base.css` nid yw'n eu hail-ddiffinio mwy. Llwythwch ef unwaith, yn rhagor na'r taflenni cydran a phros, pan\nfo pantoken yn berchen ar y dudalen."

#: formats/components/src/functions/baseCss.md
