#: formats/components/src/functions/componentsCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the aggregated component stylesheet: every component's rules in the `COMPONENTS` concat order.\nThe size-alias and alias twins are appended PER COMPONENT (within its own chunk) so each alias\ndocuments on its own page — the aliases are discovered from each record's `@alias {@link -x}` or\n`@deprecated {@link -x}` metadata (see `withAliases`), not a central hand-kept list. The\n`--instui-elevation-*` shadow scale the components reference is defined in the token sheet\n(`@pantoken/css`), so it's no longer inlined here."
msgstr "Adeiladu'r taflen arddull gydedig ar gyfer cydrannau: rheolau pob cydran yn nhrefn catenu `COMPONENTS`.\nMae size-alias a alias twins yn cael eu hychwanegu YN FEO I BOB CYDRAN (o fewn ei glwstwr ei hun) fel bod pob alias yn cael ei ddogfennu ar ei dudalen ei hun — mae'r aliasau yn cael eu darganfod o `@alias {@link -x}` neu `@deprecated {@link -x}` metadata pob cofnod (gweler `withAliases`), nid o restr ganolog a gadwyd â llaw. Mae'r cyfeiriad `--instui-elevation-*` shadow scale i'r cydrannau wedi'i ddiffinio yn y daflen token (`@pantoken/css`), felly nid yw'n cael ei fewnosod yma mwyach."

#: formats/components/src/functions/elevationCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the elevation token block: `<selector> { --instui-elevation-*: … }`. Shipped inside\n`components.css` (so shadows are intrinsic — no plugin, no extra import), and reusable by other\nlayered outputs (e.g. the Pendo renderer) via the `selector` option."
msgstr "Build the elevation token block: `&lt;selector&gt; { --instui-elevation-*: … }`. Shipped inside\n`components.css` (so shadows are intrinsic — no plugin, no extra import), and reusable by other\nlayered outputs (e.g. the Pendo renderer) via the `selector` option."

#: formats/components/src/functions/elevationCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`selector` — the rule selector (default `:root`)."
msgstr "`selector` — y dewiswr rheol (diofyn `:root`)."

#: formats/components/src/functions/elevationDeclarations.md
#: packages/utils/src/functions/elevationDeclarations.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `--instui-elevation-*` name/value pairs (each a multi-layer `box-shadow`). Values reference the\nthemed drop-shadow colour tokens, so they adapt per theme wherever a token sheet is loaded."
msgstr "Mae'r pâr enw/gwerth `--instui-elevation-*` (pob un yn `box-shadow` aml-haen). Mae'r gwerthoedd yn cyfeirio at y docynnau lliw cysgod-cwymp themad,\nfelly maent yn addasu fesul thema ble bynnag y caiff taflen docynnau ei llwytho."

#: formats/components/src/functions/elevationDeclarations.md
#: packages/utils/src/functions/elevationDeclarations.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "One `[customProperty, value]` pair per level and alias."
msgstr "Un pâr `[customProperty, value]` fesul lefel a alias."

#: formats/components/src/functions/focusOutlineCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the focus-outline block: the `--instui-focus-outline-*` token defs plus the ring rules.\nBaked into `base.css` (so focusables get the ring out of the box), and reusable by other layered\noutputs (e.g. the Pendo renderer) via the `selector`/`tokenSelector` options."
msgstr "Adeiladu bloc focus-outline: y diffiniadau tocyn `--instui-focus-outline-*` ynghyd â rheolau'r ring.\nWedi'i blygu i mewn i `base.css` (felly mae'r elfennau sy'n gallu cael ffocws yn cael y ring o'r ffatri), ac yn ail-defnyddadwy gan allbynnau haenog eraill\n(e.e. y renderer Pendo) trwy'r opsiynau `selector`/`tokenSelector`."

#: formats/components/src/functions/focusOutlineCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`selector` — the focusable selector; `tokenSelector` — where the token defs land\n  (default `:where(:root)`)."
msgstr "`selector` — yr ddewiswr sy'n derbyn ffocws; `tokenSelector` — ble y mae diffiniadau'r tocyn yn cael eu gosod\n  (diofyn `:where(:root)`)."

#: formats/components/src/functions/focusOutlineDeclarations.md
#: packages/utils/src/functions/focusOutlineDeclarations.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `--instui-focus-outline-*` name/value pairs the ring rules read. Colour/width/offset reference\nthe themed shared focus tokens; the transition, line style, and inset are constants."
msgstr "Mae'r pâr enw/gwerth `--instui-focus-outline-*` a ddarllenir gan reolau'r cylch. Mae lliw/lled/gosod yn cyfeirio at y tokenau canolbwynt rhannu â thema;\nmae'r trawsnewid, arddull llinell, a'r inset yn gysonion."

#: formats/components/src/functions/focusOutlineDeclarations.md
#: packages/utils/src/functions/focusOutlineDeclarations.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "One `[customProperty, value]` pair per focus-ring variable."
msgstr "Un pâr `[customProperty, value]` ar gyfer pob newidyn cylch canolbwynt."

#: formats/components/src/functions/focusOutlineRules.md
#: packages/utils/src/functions/focusOutlineRules.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The focus-ring rules for a given focusable selector: a transparent resting ring that transitions in\non `:focus-visible`, plus the `-focus-color-*` / `-focus-position-inset` / `-focus-within` /\n`-without-focus-animation` modifiers. All `:where()`-wrapped, so zero-specificity."
msgstr "Rheolau cylch-ffocws ar gyfer dewiswr sy'n gallu derbyn ffocws: cylch gorffenedig tryloyw sy'n trosglwyddo i mewn\nar `:focus-visible`, ynghyd â'r addasiadau `-focus-color-*` / `-focus-position-inset` / `-focus-within` /\n`-without-focus-animation`. I gyd wedi'u hamgylchynu gan `:where()`, felly dim penodoldeb."

#: formats/components/src/functions/focusOutlineRules.md
#: packages/utils/src/functions/focusOutlineRules.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The focusable selector the base ring applies to (default [FOCUSABLE\\_SELECTOR](../variables/FOCUSABLE_SELECTOR.md))."
msgstr "Y dewiswr sy'n gallu derbyn ffocws y mae'r cylch sylfaenol yn gymwys iddo (diofyn [FOCUSABLE\\_SELECTOR](../variables/FOCUSABLE_SELECTOR.md))."

#: formats/components/src/functions/focusOutlineRules.md
#: packages/utils/src/functions/focusOutlineRules.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The CSS rules string."
msgstr "Llinyn rheolau CSS."

#: formats/components/src/functions/iconGlyphsCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the icon-glyph stylesheet: one `.<prefix>-icon-<name>` class per icon that points\n`--pantoken-glyph` at the matching `--instui-icon-<name>` token. Kept out of the component bundle\n(it's large); ships as its own `icons.css`. Pass the icon names (e.g. from `@pantoken/icons`)."
msgstr "Build the icon-glyph stylesheet: one `.&lt;prefix&gt;-icon-&lt;name&gt;` class per icon that points\n`--pantoken-glyph` at the matching `--instui-icon-&lt;name&gt;` token. Kept out of the component bundle\n(it's large); ships as its own `icons.css`. Pass the icon names (e.g. from `@pantoken/icons`)."

#: formats/components/src/functions/iconGlyphsCss.md
#: packages/cli/src/functions/parseArgs.md packages/cli/src/functions/run.md
#: packages/core/src/functions/flutterIconManifest.md
#: renderers/svelte/src/functions/registerLocalized.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/formatList.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/registerLocalized.md
#: renderers/web-components/src/interfaces/LocaleSet.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "readonly `string`[]"
msgstr "readonly `string`[]"

#: formats/components/src/functions/iconGlyphsCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Icon names without the `--instui-icon-` prefix (e.g. `[\"megaphone\", \"check\"]`)."
msgstr "Enwau eicon heb y rhagddodiad `--instui-icon-` (er enghraifft `[\"megaphone\", \"check\"]`)."

#: formats/components/src/functions/iconGlyphsCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "[IconGlyphsOptions](../interfaces/IconGlyphsOptions.md) (adds `deprecatedAliases` to [ComponentOptions](../interfaces/ComponentOptions.md))."
msgstr "[IconGlyphsOptions](../interfaces/IconGlyphsOptions.md) (ychwanega `deprecatedAliases` i [ComponentOptions](../interfaces/ComponentOptions.md))."

#: formats/components/src/functions/iconGlyphsCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "This is the glyph-token half of the icon system (the `.-icon-<name>` modifiers, shipped as\n`icons.css`); the `icon` utility is the painter half (the shared `::before`). They share the `icon`\ndemo."
msgstr "This is the glyph-token half of the icon system (the `.-icon-&lt;name&gt;` modifiers, shipped as\n`icons.css`); the `icon` utility is the painter half (the shared `::before`). They share the `icon`\ndemo."

#: formats/components/src/functions/proseCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the InstUI-look prose stylesheet, scoped to `options.scope` (default `:where(body)`, so it\napplies automatically without a wrapper class — like `base.css`)."
msgstr "Adeiladu'r dafelen arddull prosa InstUI-look, wedi'i gyfyngu i `options.scope` (diofyn `:where(body)`, felly caiff ei gymhwyso'n awtomatig heb ddosbarth lapio — fel `base.css`)."

#: formats/components/src/functions/selectCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **experimental** customizable-select enhancement for `.<prefix>-simple-select`. Everything is\ngated behind `@supports (appearance: base-select)` (the CSS Customizable Select model — Chrome 135+,\nNOT yet Baseline), so it's pure progressive enhancement: browsers without support keep the plain\n`simpleSelectCss` control; supporting browsers get a styled `::picker(select)` panel and styled\n`option`s (hover/selected) from the `--instui-component-options-item-*` tokens. Shipped as its own\nopt-in `select.css` (like `fonts.css`) rather than folded into `components.css`, precisely because the\nfeature is experimental — you opt in deliberately."
msgstr "The **experimental** customizable-select enhancement for `.&lt;prefix&gt;-simple-select`. Everything is\ngated behind `@supports (appearance: base-select)` (the CSS Customizable Select model — Chrome 135+,\nNOT yet Baseline), so it's pure progressive enhancement: browsers without support keep the plain\n`simpleSelectCss` control; supporting browsers get a styled `::picker(select)` panel and styled\n`option`s (hover/selected) from the `--instui-component-options-item-*` tokens. Shipped as its own\nopt-in `select.css` (like `fonts.css`) rather than folded into `components.css`, precisely because the\nfeature is experimental — you opt in deliberately."

#: formats/components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/components` — an InstUI-look CSS component library, built from the `--instui-*` tokens."
msgstr "`@pantoken/components` — llyfrgell gydrannau CSS â golwg InstUI, wedi’i hadeiladu o'r tokenau `--instui-*`."

#: formats/components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The shipped stylesheets:"
msgstr "Y taflenni steil a anfonir:"

#: formats/components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- **Base** ([baseCss](functions/baseCss.md)) — opt-in global document defaults from the tokens (box-sizing, body\n  reset, page surface, base text colour/font, `color-scheme`). It also carries the focus-outline\n  ring, so every focusable gets an accessible `:focus-visible` outline out of the box. Load it when\n  pantoken owns the page.\n- **Prose** ([proseCss](functions/proseCss.md)) — styles rendered markdown/prose HTML (tables, headings, links,\n  lists, code) scoped to a content root, so a docs page or content region looks like InstUI\n  without swapping the DOM for components. This is what the site renderers ship as their\n  `components.css`.\n- **Components** ([buttonCss](variables/buttonCss.md), [alertCss](variables/alertCss.md), [badgeCss](variables/badgeCss.md), aggregated by\n  [componentsCss](functions/componentsCss.md)) — class-based component styles you apply to your own markup\n  (`<button class=\"instui-button\">`), for the InstUI look outside a component framework. The\n  `--instui-elevation-*` shadow scale ([elevationCss](functions/elevationCss.md)) leads this sheet, since enough\n  components float that shadows are an intrinsic design attribute rather than an add-on.\n- **Utilities** ([viewCss](variables/viewCss.md), [spacingUtilitiesCss](variables/spacingUtilitiesCss.md), [gapCss](variables/gapCss.md), [layoutUtilitiesCss](variables/layoutUtilitiesCss.md), plus a\n  curated semantic-colour/token set) — an opt-in layer of cross-cutting classes. The generic\n  token→class emitters (`colorUtilitiesCss`, `tokenUtilitiesCss`) live in `@pantoken/utils`; this\n  package feeds them the curated *semantic* names, while `@pantoken/plugin-primitives` feeds the raw\n  palette.\n- **Fonts** (opt-in `fonts.css`) — the `@font-face` rules for the Instructure brand fonts. Base\n  *applies* the font; `fonts.css` *loads* the woff2s, so text degrades gracefully without it."
msgstr "- **Base** ([baseCss](functions/baseCss.md)) — diofynion dogfen byd-eang dewisol o’r tokenau (box-sizing, ailosod\n  corff, arwyneb tudalen, lliw/testun sylfaen/ffont, `color-scheme`). Mae hefyd yn cynnwys y cylch\n  canolbwyntio-outline, felly mae gan bob elfen y gellid ei ffókusio allu cyrraedd `:focus-visible` yn hygyrch allan o’r blwch. Llwythwch ef pan\n  mae pantoken yn berchen ar y dudalen.\n- **Prose** ([proseCss](functions/proseCss.md)) — steiliau ar gyfer HTML marciadwy/prose a gyflwynir (tablau, penawdau, dolenni,\n  rhestri, cod) wedi’u cwmpasu i ganghennad cynnwys, fel bod tudalen ddogfen neu ran o gynnwys yn edrych fel InstUI\n  heb newid y DOM am gydrannau. Hwn yw'r hyn y mae rendrwyr y safle yn ei anfon fel eu\n  `components.css`.\n- **Components** ([buttonCss](variables/buttonCss.md), [alertCss](variables/alertCss.md), [badgeCss](variables/badgeCss.md), aggregated by\n  [componentsCss](functions/componentsCss.md)) — steiliau cydrannau seiliedig ar ddosbarth y gellir eu defnyddio ar eich own markup\n  (`<button class=\"instui-button\">`), ar gyfer golwg InstUI y tu allan i fframewaith cydran. Mae'r\n  raddfa cysgod `--instui-elevation-*` ([elevationCss](functions/elevationCss.md)) yn arwain y daflen hon, gan fod digon o\n  gydrannau'n hofran fel bod cysgodion yn nodwedd dylunio mewnol yn hytrach na rhywbeth ychwanegol.\n- **Utilities** ([viewCss](variables/viewCss.md), [spacingUtilitiesCss](variables/spacingUtilitiesCss.md), [gapCss](variables/gapCss.md), [layoutUtilitiesCss](variables/layoutUtilitiesCss.md), plus a\n  curated semantic-colour/token set) — haen ddewisol o ddosbarthiadau traws-gylchol. Mae'r\n  emitwyr token→dosbarth cyffredinol (`colorUtilitiesCss`, `tokenUtilitiesCss`) yn byw yn `@pantoken/utils`; mae'r\n  pecyn hwn yn eu cyflenwi gyda'r enwau *semanteg* curadur, tra bod `@pantoken/plugin-primitives` yn cyflenwi'r\n  palette crai.\n- **Fonts** (opt-in `fonts.css`) — y rheolau `@font-face` ar gyfer ffontiau brand Instructure. Mae Base\n  yn *gosod* y ffont; mae `fonts.css` yn *llwytho* y woff2s, felly mae testun yn diraddio'n raslon hebddo."

#: formats/components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Everything is pure CSS derived from the token IR, so it tracks InstUI through the tokens with no\ndependency on the InstUI React packages. For the real, interactive components, use\n`@pantoken/react-markdown` (content) or `@instructure/ui-*` (apps)."
msgstr "Mae popeth yn CSS pur a deilliodd o IR y tokenau, felly mae'n dilyn InstUI drwy'r tokenau heb unrhyw ddibyniaeth ar y pecynnau React InstUI. Ar gyfer y cydrannau rhyngweithiol go iawn, defnyddiwch\n`@pantoken/react-markdown` (content) neu `@instructure/ui-*` (apps)."

#: formats/components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "This module is a barrel: each documented record lives in its own file under\n`components/`/`utilities/`/`rules/`/`declarations/`, authored with the `lib/` compose API. The\nregistries (`COMPONENTS`/`UTILITIES`/`RULES`/`DECLARATIONS`) drive aggregation + the parity test."
msgstr "Mae'r modiwl hwn yn 'barrel': mae pob cofnod a ddogfenwyd yn byw yn ei ffeil ei hun o dan\n`components/`/`utilities/`/`rules/`/`declarations/`, wedi'i lunio gyda'r API cyfansoddi `lib/`. Mae'r\ncofrestriadau (`COMPONENTS`/`UTILITIES`/`RULES`/`DECLARATIONS`) yn gyrru'r gwaith o grynhoi +'r prawf cydberthynas."

#: formats/components/src/interfaces/ComponentOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options common to every builder."
msgstr "Dewisiadau sy'n gyffredin i bob adeilydd."

#: formats/components/src/interfaces/ComponentOptions.md
#: formats/components/src/interfaces/IconGlyphsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The class prefix. A truthy string namespaces every class (`\"instui\"` → `.instui-button`); any\nfalsy value (`null`, `undefined`, `\"\"`, or omitting the option) drops the prefix entirely\n(`.button`), so you can author `class=\"heading -h1\"`. The stylesheets shipped by this package are\nbuilt with `\"instui\"`."
msgstr "Rhagddodiad dosbarth. Mae llinyn gwirion yn rhoi gofod enwau i bob dosbarth (`\"instui\"` → `.instui-button`); bydd unrhyw werth anghywir (`null`, `undefined`, `\"\"`, neu os caiff y dewis ei hepgor) yn tynnu'r rhagddodiad yn gyfan gwbl (`.button`), felly gallwch greu `class=\"heading -h1\"`. Mae'r taflenni steil a anfonir gyda'r pecyn hwn wedi'u hadeiladu gyda `\"instui\"`."

#: formats/components/src/interfaces/ComponentOptions.md
#: formats/components/src/interfaces/IconGlyphsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Target theme for emitted CSS. Defaults to `\"rebrand\"` when omitted."
msgstr "Thema darged ar gyfer y CSS a anfonir. Yn ddiofyn mae'n `\"rebrand\"` pan gaiff ei hepgor."

#: formats/components/src/interfaces/IconGlyphsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [iconGlyphsCss](../functions/iconGlyphsCss.md)."
msgstr "Dewisiadau ar gyfer [iconGlyphsCss](../functions/iconGlyphsCss.md)."

#: formats/components/src/interfaces/IconGlyphsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Also emit the deprecated InstUI-prop glyph aliases (`-render-icon-<name>`, `-render-custom-icon-<name>`)\nas functional aliases of `-icon-<name>`. Off by default — turning it on roughly doubles the sheet, so\nenable it only when you need markup written against the old `renderIcon`/`renderCustomIcon` prop names\nto keep rendering. The shipped `icons.css` is built with this on."
msgstr "Also emit the deprecated InstUI-prop glyph aliases (`-render-icon-&lt;name&gt;`, `-render-custom-icon-&lt;name&gt;`)\nas functional aliases of `-icon-&lt;name&gt;`. Off by default — turning it on roughly doubles the sheet, so\nenable it only when you need markup written against the old `renderIcon`/`renderCustomIcon` prop names\nto keep rendering. The shipped `icons.css` is built with this on."

#: formats/components/src/interfaces/ProseOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [proseCss](../functions/proseCss.md)."
msgstr "Dewisiadau ar gyfer [proseCss](../functions/proseCss.md)."

#: formats/components/src/interfaces/ProseOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The content-root selector the rules attach to (default `\":where(body)\"`, applied automatically\n like `base.css` — pass a class like `\".vp-doc\"` to scope to a different content root instead)."
msgstr "Y dewiswr content-root y mae'r rheolau yn eu cysylltu ag ef (diofyn `\":where(body)\"`, yn cael ei gymhwyso'n awtomatig\n fel `base.css` — pasio dosbarth fel `\".vp-doc\"` i'w gyfyngu i wraidd cynnwys gwahanol yn ei le)."

#: formats/components/src/variables/DEFAULT_PREFIX.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The default class prefix (`instui` → `.instui-button`)."
msgstr "Rhagddodiad dosbarth diofyn (`instui` → `.instui-button`)."

#: formats/components/src/variables/ELEVATION_NAMES.md
#: packages/utils/src/variables/ELEVATION_NAMES.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Every elevation level and alias emitted as `--instui-elevation-<name>` (`resting`, `above`,\n`topmost`, `depth1`–`depth3`, `card`, `cardHover`). Derived from the geometry + alias maps."
msgstr "Every elevation level and alias emitted as `--instui-elevation-&lt;name&gt;` (`resting`, `above`,\n`topmost`, `depth1`–`depth3`, `card`, `cardHover`). Derived from the geometry + alias maps."

#: formats/components/src/variables/FOCUSABLE_SELECTOR.md
#: packages/utils/src/variables/FOCUSABLE_SELECTOR.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The elements the ring applies to by default (the common interactive/focusable elements)."
msgstr "Yr elfennau y mae'r cylch yn cael ei gymhwyso arnynt yn ddiofyn (yr elfennau rhyngweithiol/canolbwyntio cyffredin)."

#: formats/components/src/variables/alertCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Standalone `alert` stylesheet — the prefixed CSS for the status message, ready to ship as a `.css` file."
msgstr "Taflen arddull annibynnol `alert` — y CSS wedi'i rhagffixio ar gyfer y neges statws, yn barod i'w anfon fel ffeil `.css`."

#: formats/components/src/variables/avatarCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Standalone `avatar` stylesheet — the prefixed CSS for the avatar, ready to ship as a `.css` file."
msgstr "Stylesheet annibynnol `avatar` — y CSS gyda rhagddodiadau ar gyfer yr avatar, yn barod i’w anfon fel ffeil `.css`."

#: formats/components/src/variables/badgeCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Standalone `badge` stylesheet — the prefixed CSS for the count-and-status badge, ready to ship as a `.css` file."
msgstr "Stylesheet `badge` annibynnol — y CSS gyda rhagffix ar gyfer y bathodyn cyfrif a statws, yn barod i'w anfon fel ffeil `.css`."

#: formats/components/src/variables/billboardCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Standalone `billboard` stylesheet — the prefixed CSS for the empty-state block, ready to ship as a `.css` file."
msgstr "Taflen arddull annibynnol `billboard` — y CSS gyda rhagddodiad ar gyfer bloc cyflwr-gwag, yn barod i'w anfon fel ffeil `.css`."

#: formats/components/src/variables/breadcrumbCss.md
