msgid "The dangling reference names."
msgstr "Yr enwau cyfeiriadau ar goll."

#: packages/utils/src/functions/extractInstuiRefs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Every `--instui-*` custom-property name that appears anywhere in `text`."
msgstr "Pob enw eiddo wedi'i addasu `--instui-*` sy'n ymddangos unrhyw le yn `text`."

#: packages/utils/src/functions/globalModifierSelector.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build a global-utility modifier selector: `:where(*).--name.--name.--name`. The modifier class\nrepeated 3x gives the rule (0,3,0) specificity, which deterministically outranks any real 2-class\ncomponent-modifier compound (`.instui-view.-mod`, 0,2,0) regardless of source order — the `:where(*)`\nwrapper contributes zero specificity of its own, so it's purely documentation that this is a global\nmodifier, not a scoping condition. A plain class selector already matches standalone (`--mt-lg` with\nno other class) or chained onto any component, core or plugin-authored, with no per-component\nenumeration needed. Replaces the old bare-class-plus-enumerated-per-component-compound pattern\n(`globalSelectors`/`chainTargets`), which couldn't reach plugin-authored components and didn't scale\nto high-cardinality utilities like spacing."
msgstr "Adeiladu dewiswr modiwffyr defnydd cyffredinol byd-eang: `:where(*).--name.--name.--name`. Mae’r dosbarth modiwffyr a ailadroddir 3x yn rhoi penodoldeb rheol (0,3,0), sy’n rhagori’n benderfynol ar unrhyw gyfansawdd gwirol o 2-ddosbarth o fath component-modiwffyr (`.instui-view.-mod`, 0,2,0) waeth beth fo trefn y ffynhonnell — nid yw’r lapio `:where(*)` yn cyfrannu unrhyw benodoldeb o’i groen ei hun, felly mae’n ddogfen-lun yn unig sy’n dangos mai modiwffyr byd-eang yw hwn, nid amod cwmpasu. Mae dewiswr dosbarth syml eisoes yn cyfateb i uned annibynnol (`--mt-lg` heb unrhyw ddosbarth arall) neu pan gaiff ei gysylltu â unrhyw gydran, boed yn main neu a grëwyd gan becyn ychwanegol, heb angen rhestru fesul-cydran. Yn disodli’r patrwm hen o ddosbarth-di-ymyl-yn-ysig-â-rhestr-fesul-cydran (`globalSelectors`/`chainTargets`), nad oedd yn cyrraedd cydrannau a grëwyd gan becynnau ychwanegol ac nad oedd yn graddio i weithrediadau uchel-carifarf fel gofod."

#: packages/utils/src/functions/parseHexColor.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Parse `#rgb`, `#rrggbb`, or `#rrggbbaa` to [Rgba](../interfaces/Rgba.md); returns `undefined` otherwise."
msgstr "Parsiwch `#rgb`, `#rrggbb`, neu `#rrggbbaa` i [Rgba](../interfaces/Rgba.md); yn dychwelyd `undefined` fel arall."

#: packages/utils/src/functions/sanitizeSvg.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Strip `<script>` elements and event-handler attributes from SVG markup."
msgstr "Strip `&lt;script&gt;` elements and event-handler attributes from SVG markup."

#: packages/utils/src/functions/sanitizeSvg.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Defense-in-depth for SVG decoded from vendored data URIs or contributed by plugins.\nNot a full HTML parser — relies on the upstream source being trusted and pinned."
msgstr "Amddiffyniad dwfn ar gyfer SVG a ddatgodedir o URIau data a gyflenwir gan ranbarthwyr neu a roddir gan ategion.\nNid yw'n ddadansoddwr HTML llawn — mae'n dibynnu ar y ffynhonnell uchaf gael ei hymddiried ynddi a'i phinio."

#: packages/utils/src/functions/tokenNames.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The set of token names an IR defines."
msgstr "Y set o enwau tocyn y mae IR yn eu diffinio."

#: packages/utils/src/functions/tokenUtilitiesCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build token-driven utility classes: one class per token, applying it to its natural CSS property. The\ntoken's `--instui-` tail is the class name, so `--instui-font-weight-body-strong` under property\n`font-weight` yields\n`.<prefix>-font-weight-body-strong { font-weight: var(--instui-font-weight-body-strong); }`. Use it for\nevery \"one token → one property\" family (font-family/weight, line-height, border-radius, border-width,\nopacity, box-shadow). Colour and spacing keep their own builders — one token maps to several\nproperties there. Pass the token names per property (e.g. filtered from `@pantoken/tokens`)."
msgstr "Build token-driven utility classes: one class per token, applying it to its natural CSS property. The\ntoken's `--instui-` tail is the class name, so `--instui-font-weight-body-strong` under property\n`font-weight` yields\n`.&lt;prefix&gt;-font-weight-body-strong { font-weight: var(--instui-font-weight-body-strong); }`. Use it for\nevery \"one token → one property\" family (font-family/weight, line-height, border-radius, border-width,\nopacity, box-shadow). Colour and spacing keep their own builders — one token maps to several\nproperties there. Pass the token names per property (e.g. filtered from `@pantoken/tokens`)."

#: packages/utils/src/functions/tokenUtilitiesCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "readonly [`TokenUtilityGroup`](../interfaces/TokenUtilityGroup.md)[]"
msgstr "darllen-yn-unig [`TokenUtilityGroup`](../interfaces/TokenUtilityGroup.md)[]"

#: packages/utils/src/functions/tokenUtilitiesCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "one [TokenUtilityGroup](../interfaces/TokenUtilityGroup.md) per CSS property."
msgstr "un [TokenUtilityGroup](../interfaces/TokenUtilityGroup.md) fesul eiddo CSS."

#: packages/utils/src/functions/unknownReferences.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Drift check: `--instui-*` names in `text` that the IR doesn't define (sorted; empty means no\ndrift). Use for outputs that *reference* tokens defined elsewhere — e.g. the docusaurus/vitepress\nbridges, whose `var(--instui-*)` targets must all be real tokens."
msgstr "Gwiriad drifft: `--instui-*` enwau yn `text` nad yw'r IR yn eu diffinio (trefnedig; mae 'gwag' yn golygu nad oes\ndriff). Defnyddiwch ar gyfer allbynnau sy'n *cyfeirio at* tocynnau a ddiffinnir yn rhywle arall — er enghraifft y pontydd docusaurus/vitepress\nlle mae targedau `var(--instui-*)` i gyd yn rhaid i fod yn docynnau go iawn."

#: packages/utils/src/functions/unknownReferences.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The generated output."
msgstr "Y allbwn a gynhyrchwyd."

#: packages/utils/src/functions/unknownReferences.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The source token IR."
msgstr "IR tocynnau'r ffynhonnell."

#: packages/utils/src/functions/unknownReferences.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The unknown token names."
msgstr "Yr enwau tocynnau anhysbys."

#: packages/utils/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/utils` — shared, upstream-free helpers used across the pantoken packages: the token\nreference resolver (with `light-dark()` handling), the two token regexes (typed via `arkregex`),\nkebab→camel case, hex-colour parsing, SVG sanitization, the pantoken spacing scale, reference-drift\nvalidation, and the generic token→utility-class emitters that both `@pantoken/components`\n(semantic tier) and `@pantoken/plugin-primitives` (raw-palette tier) build on. Depends only on\n`@pantoken/model` (types) + `arkregex`, so any package can use it without pulling the GitHub-only\nupstream."
msgstr "`@pantoken/utils` — cymorthwyr rhannol, heb unrhyw ddibyniaeth upstream a ddefnyddir ar draws pecynnau pantoken: y datryswr cyfeiriad token (gyda `light-dark()` yn trinio), y ddau regez o token (typed trwy `arkregex`), kebab→camel case, dad-ddehongli lliw hex, diogelwch SVG, raddfa gofod pantoken, dilysu difrifoldeb cyfeiriadau (reference-drift), a'r emitwyr cyffredinol token→dosbarth-lymp (utility-class) y mae'r ddau `@pantoken/components` (haen semantig) a `@pantoken/plugin-primitives` (haen palet crai) yn seilio arnynt. Dibynia'n unig ar `@pantoken/model` (mathau) + `arkregex`, felly gall unrhyw becyn ei ddefnyddio heb dynnu'r upstream sy'n unigol i GitHub."

#: packages/utils/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The css-tree-backed token syntax validator lives at the separate `@pantoken/utils/token-syntax`\nentry, not this barrel — `css-tree` bundles a runtime `createRequire()` JSON load that breaks when\npulled into a browser/SSR bundle, and this barrel is imported by browser-facing packages (e.g.\n`@pantoken/components`) for the Node-free helpers above."
msgstr "Mae'r dilysydd sintacs token sydd â chefnogaeth css-tree yn byw yn y mynediad ar wahân `@pantoken/utils/token-syntax`, nid yn y barrel hwn — mae `css-tree` yn pacio llwythiad runtime `createRequire()` JSON sydd yn torri pan gaiff ei dynnu i fagl porwr/SSR, ac mae'r barrel hwn yn cael ei fewnforio gan becynnau sy'n wynebu porwr (er enghraifft `@pantoken/components`) ar gyfer y cymorthwyr heb Node uchod."

#: packages/utils/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A pure barrel — every implementation lives in its own discrete module; add new helpers there and\nre-export them here, don't grow this file."
msgstr "Barrel pur — mae pob gweithrediad yn byw yn ei fodiwl gwahanol ei hun; ychwanegwch gymorthwyr newydd yno a eu hailallforio yma, peidiwch â rhoi mwy o gynnwys i'r ffeil hon."

#: packages/utils/src/interfaces/ColorUtilityNames.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The semantic colour token names (or explicit `[name, token]` pairs) per family."
msgstr "Enwau tocyn lliw semanteg (neu bârau `[name, token]` eglur) fesul teulu."

#: packages/utils/src/interfaces/Rgba.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An RGBA colour: `r`/`g`/`b` are 0–255 integers, `a` is 0–1 (defaults to 1)."
msgstr "Lliw RGBA: `r`/`g`/`b` yw rhifau cyfan 0–255, `a` yw 0–1 (yn ddiofyn 1)."

#: packages/utils/src/interfaces/SpacingStep.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "One entry of the pantoken spacing scale: the short key, the long (word) key, and the shared CSS value."
msgstr "Un eitem o raddfa lledu pantoken: y allwedd fyr, y allwedd hir (air), a'r gwerth CSS a rennir."

#: packages/utils/src/interfaces/SpacingStep.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The short scale key, e.g. `\"sm\"` (the zero step's short key is `\"0\"`)."
msgstr "Yr allwedd fyr o'r raddfa, er enghraifft `\"sm\"` (yr allwedd fyr ar gyfer cam sero yw `\"0\"`)."

#: packages/utils/src/interfaces/SpacingStep.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The long, word-spelled key, e.g. `\"small\"` (the zero step's long key is `\"none\"`)."
msgstr "Yr allwedd hir, wedi'i sillafu fel gair, er enghraifft `\"small\"` (yr allwedd hir ar gyfer cam sero yw `\"none\"`)."

#: packages/utils/src/interfaces/SpacingStep.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The CSS value — a token reference, or a plain `\"0\"`/`\"auto\"`."
msgstr "Y gwerth CSS — cyfeiriad tocyn, neu `\"0\"`/`\"auto\"` syml."

#: packages/utils/src/interfaces/TokenUtilityGroup.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A set of tokens that all map to one CSS property (e.g. every `--instui-font-weight-*` → `font-weight`)."
msgstr "Set o docynnau sy'n cyfateb i un eiddo CSS (er enghraifft, pob `--instui-font-weight-*` → `font-weight`)."

#: packages/utils/src/interfaces/TokenUtilityGroup.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The CSS property the tokens set (e.g. `\"font-weight\"`, `\"border-radius\"`, `\"box-shadow\"`)."
msgstr "Yr eiddo CSS y mae'r set o docynnau'n ei osod (er enghraifft, `\"font-weight\"`, `\"border-radius\"`, `\"box-shadow\"`)."

#: packages/utils/src/interfaces/TokenUtilityGroup.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Full token names (e.g. `\"--instui-font-weight-body-strong\"`); the `--instui-` tail becomes the class."
msgstr "Enwau tocynnau llawn (er enghraifft, `\"--instui-font-weight-body-strong\"`); mae'r atodiad `--instui-` yn troi'n ddosbarth."

#: packages/utils/src/interfaces/UtilityOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options shared by the utility-class emitters."
msgstr "Opsiynau a rennir gan allywyr utility-class."

#: packages/utils/src/interfaces/UtilityOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The class prefix. Any truthy string namespaces every class (`\"instui\"` → `.instui-bg-…`); any\nfalsy value (`null`/`undefined`/`\"\"`) drops the prefix entirely (`.bg-…`)."
msgstr "Y rhagddodiad dosbarth. Any llinyn gwirioneddol yn enbynsio pob dosbarth (`\"instui\"` → `.instui-bg-…`);\nany werth ffals (`null`/`undefined`/`\"\"`) yn gwaredu'r rhagddodiad yn gyfan (`.bg-…`)."

#: packages/utils/src/type-aliases/ColorUtilityEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "One semantic colour family entry: a bare name (resolved against `--instui-color-<family>-<name>`)\n or an explicit `[name, value]` pair — the second element is `var()`-wrapped if it's a `--custom-prop`\n name, or used verbatim otherwise (a `light-dark(…)` expression, a raw keyword like `transparent`)."
msgstr "One semantic colour family entry: a bare name (resolved against `--instui-color-&lt;family&gt;-&lt;name&gt;`)\n or an explicit `[name, value]` pair — the second element is `var()`-wrapped if it's a `--custom-prop`\n name, or used verbatim otherwise (a `light-dark(…)` expression, a raw keyword like `transparent`)."

#: packages/utils/src/variables/LIGHT_DARK_RE.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A `light-dark(<light>, <dark>)` value; capture groups 1 and 2 are the two branches."
msgstr "A `light-dark(&lt;light&gt;, &lt;dark&gt;)` value; capture groups 1 and 2 are the two branches."

#: packages/utils/src/variables/SPACING_AUTO_STEP.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `auto` step — margin only, spelled the same both ways."
msgstr "Y cam `auto` — dim ond margîn, wedi'i sillafu'r un fath yn y ddau fodd."

#: packages/utils/src/variables/SPACING_STEPS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The pantoken spacing scale, `none`/`0` → `2xl` — the single shared source for\n`@pantoken/components`' spacing/gap utilities and `@pantoken/interactions`' `resolveSpace`, so the\ntwo never drift apart."
msgstr "Y raddfa bylchau pantoken, `none`/`0` → `2xl` — y ffynhonell rannu sengl ar gyfer\nofferynnau gofod/bwlch `@pantoken/components` a `@pantoken/interactions`' `resolveSpace`, fel na fydd y\nddau byth yn ymwahanu."

#: packages/utils/src/variables/VAR_RE.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A `var(--custom-prop)` reference (optional fallback); capture group 1 is the property name."
msgstr "Cyfeirnod `var(--custom-prop)` (ateb amgen dewisol); grŵp dal 1 yw enw’r eiddo."

#: platforms/android/src/functions/generateAndroid.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Emit Android resource XML for a named theme (using the vendored `@pantoken/tokens` IR)."
msgstr "Allbynnwch XML adnodd Android ar gyfer thema enwad (gan ddefnyddio'r IR `@pantoken/tokens` wedi'i becynnu)."

#: platforms/android/src/functions/generateAndroid.md
#: platforms/android/src/functions/toAndroid.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The paths of the written `colors.xml` and `dimens.xml`."
msgstr "Y llwybrau o'r `colors.xml` a'r `dimens.xml` a ysgrifennwyd."

#: platforms/android/src/functions/toAndroid.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Emit Android resource XML for an explicit token IR."
msgstr "Generu XML adnodd Android ar gyfer IR tocyn penodol."

#: platforms/android/src/functions/toAndroid.md
#: platforms/compose/src/functions/toCompose.md
#: platforms/flutter/src/functions/toFlutter.md
#: platforms/swift/src/functions/toSwift.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Emit a specific theme's IR**"
msgstr "**Generu IR thema penodol**"

#: platforms/android/src/functions/toAndroid.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Dark mode with icon VectorDrawables**"
msgstr "**Modd tywyll gyda VectorDrawables eicon**"

#: platforms/android/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/android` — emit Instructure design tokens as Android resource XML."
msgstr "`@pantoken/android` — allforio tokenau dyluniad Instructure fel XML adnodd Android."

#: platforms/android/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It flattens the IR to concrete, single-mode values (`@pantoken/core`'s `toStyleDictionary`), then\nemits `res/values/colors.xml` (colour tokens) and `res/values/dimens.xml` (dimension tokens) via\n`@pantoken/sd-config`. Style Dictionary applies the Android transforms (`#aarrggbb`, `dp`/`sp`)."
msgstr "Mae'n troi'r IR yn werthoedd concrid, un‑modd (`@pantoken/core`'s `toStyleDictionary`), yna\nyn allforio `res/values/colors.xml` (tokenau lliw) a `res/values/dimens.xml` (tokenau dimensiwn) drwy\n`@pantoken/sd-config`. Mae Style Dictionary yn defnyddio'r trawsnewidiadau Android (`#aarrggbb`, `dp`/`sp`)."

#: platforms/android/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [generateAndroid](functions/generateAndroid.md)"
msgstr "Ailenwi ac ail-allforio [generateAndroid](functions/generateAndroid.md)"

#: platforms/android/src/interfaces/GenerateAndroidOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [generateAndroid](../functions/generateAndroid.md) / [toAndroid](../functions/toAndroid.md)."
msgstr "Opsiynau ar gyfer [generateAndroid](../functions/generateAndroid.md) / [toAndroid](../functions/toAndroid.md)."

#: platforms/android/src/interfaces/GenerateAndroidOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The output directory; files are written under `<outDir>/res/values`."
msgstr "The output directory; files are written under `&lt;outDir&gt;/res/values`."

#: platforms/android/src/interfaces/GenerateAndroidOptions.md
#: platforms/swift/src/interfaces/GenerateSwiftOptions.md
#: renderers/astro/src/interfaces/InstUIOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The theme to emit (default: `\"rebrand\"`)."
msgstr "Y thema i'w hallyrru (diofyn: `\"rebrand\"`)."

#: platforms/android/src/interfaces/GenerateAndroidOptions.md
#: platforms/swift/src/interfaces/GenerateSwiftOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Which `light-dark()` mode to resolve (default: `\"light\"`)."
msgstr "Pa fodd `light-dark()` i'w ddatrys (diofyn: `\"light\"`)."

#: platforms/android/src/interfaces/GenerateAndroidOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Icon names to also emit as VectorDrawables under `res/drawable` (default: none)."
msgstr "Enwau eiconau i'w hallyrru hefyd fel VectorDrawables o dan `res/drawable` (diofyn: dim)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/functions/buildTheme.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build both theme.css and theme.js for the given provider/asset selection."
msgstr "Adeiladu'r ddau theme.css a theme.js ar gyfer y dewis darparwr/aset a roddwyd."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/functions/buildThemeCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build theme.css content for the given provider/asset selection."
msgstr "Adeiladu cynnwys theme.css ar gyfer y darparwr/aset a ddewiswyd."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/functions/buildThemeJs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build theme.js content for the given provider/asset selection."
msgstr "Adeiladu cynnwys theme.js ar gyfer y dewis darparwr/aset a roddwyd."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/functions/defaultThemeCssAssets.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The component-style sheets for a given theme/mode pair (token sheet plus the constant set)."
msgstr "Y taflenni arddull cydrannau ar gyfer par thema/modd penodedig (taflen tocyn ynghyd â'r set gyson)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/canvas-theme-editor` — upload-ready `theme.css`/`theme.js` for Canvas LMS's Theme\nEditor, pre-wired to pantoken's CDN-hosted CSS. Consumed by `@pantoken/scaffold`'s\n`canvas-theme-editor` platform; also usable standalone."
msgstr "`@pantoken/canvas-theme-editor` — `theme.css`/`theme.js` sy'n barod i'w huwchlwytho ar gyfer Golygydd Thema Canvas LMS,\nwedi'i gysylltu ymlaen llaw â CSS pantoken a geir ar CDN. Yn cael ei ddefnyddio gan lwyfan `canvas-theme-editor` `@pantoken/scaffold`; hefyd yn ddefnyddiol yn annibynnol."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`THEME_CSS`/`THEME_JS` are the jsDelivr-default, unpinned output — use [buildTheme](functions/buildTheme.md) to\ntarget a different CDN provider, pin a version, or swap in other pantoken/third-party assets."
msgstr "`THEME_CSS`/`THEME_JS` yw'r allbwn diofyn jsDelivr, heb ei binnedu — defnyddiwch [buildTheme](functions/buildTheme.md) i dargedu darparwr CDN gwahanol, pinio fersiwn, neu ddisodli ag asedau pantoken/trydydd-parti eraill."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [buildTheme](../functions/buildTheme.md)/[buildThemeCss](../functions/buildThemeCss.md)/[buildThemeJs](../functions/buildThemeJs.md)."
msgstr "Dewisiadau ar gyfer [buildTheme](../functions/buildTheme.md)/[buildThemeCss](../functions/buildThemeCss.md)/[buildThemeJs](../functions/buildThemeJs.md)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The CDN provider to build URLs for. Defaults to jsDelivr when omitted."
msgstr "Y darparwr CDN i adeiladu URLau ar ei gyfer. Yn ddiofyn yw jsDelivr pan gaiff ei hepgor."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Pins the version for every asset below that doesn't specify its own `version`."
msgstr "Mae'n gosod fersiwn ar gyfer pob ased isod nad yw'n nodi ei `version` ei hun."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Token theme variant. Defaults to `\"rebrand\"`. Ignored when `css` is supplied."
msgstr "Amrywiad thema token. Yn ddiofyn `\"rebrand\"`. Wedi'i anwybyddu pan fo `css` yn cael ei gyflenwi."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Rebrand token mode. Defaults to `\"light\"`. Ignored outside the `rebrand` theme, or when `css` is supplied."
msgstr "Modd token ailfrandio. Yn ddiofyn `\"light\"`. Wedi'i anwybyddu y tu allan i'r thema `rebrand`, neu pan fo `css` yn cael ei gyflenwi."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Component-style sheets. Defaults to [defaultThemeCssAssets](../functions/defaultThemeCssAssets.md) for `theme`/`mode`."
msgstr "Taflenni steil cydrannau. Yn ddiofyn i [defaultThemeCssAssets](../functions/defaultThemeCssAssets.md) ar gyfer `theme`/`mode`."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Font sheet(s). Defaults to [DEFAULT\\_THEME\\_FONT\\_ASSETS](../variables/DEFAULT_THEME_FONT_ASSETS.md)."
msgstr "Taflen(ni) ffont. Yn ddiofyn i [DEFAULT\\_THEME\\_FONT\\_ASSETS](../variables/DEFAULT_THEME_FONT_ASSETS.md)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Script(s). Defaults to [DEFAULT\\_THEME\\_JS\\_ASSETS](../variables/DEFAULT_THEME_JS_ASSETS.md)."
msgstr "Sgript(i). Yn ddiofyn i [DEFAULT\\_THEME\\_JS\\_ASSETS](../variables/DEFAULT_THEME_JS_ASSETS.md)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/BuildThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Translated comment strings. Defaults to [ENGLISH\\_THEME\\_STRINGS](../variables/ENGLISH_THEME_STRINGS.md)."
msgstr "Llinynnau sylw wedi'u cyfieithu. Yn ddiofyn i [ENGLISH\\_THEME\\_STRINGS](../variables/ENGLISH_THEME_STRINGS.md)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A single file to load from a CDN, identified by npm package name and path within it."
msgstr "Ffeil unigol i'w llwytho o CDN, wedi'i nodi gan enw pecyn npm a llwybr o fewn y pecyn."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The npm package name, e.g. `\"@pantoken/components\"`."
msgstr "Enw'r pecyn npm, er enghraifft `\"@pantoken/components\"`."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The path within the package, e.g. `\"dist/components.css\"`. Omit to reference the package root."
msgstr "Y llwybr o fewn y pecyn, er enghraifft `\"dist/components.css\"`. Gadael heb ei bennu i gyfeirio at wraidd y pecyn."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Overrides the provider/build-level version for this file only."
msgstr "Yn gorlifo'r fersiwn ar lefel y darparwr/adeiladu ar gyfer y ffeil hon yn unig."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "For providers that transform JS by default (esm.sh): `false` lets the provider apply its normal\nESM transform (needed to `import` a real package entry point). Defaults to `true` — serve the\nfile verbatim, required for prebuilt/non-ESM assets like CSS sheets and IIFE bundles."
msgstr "Ar gyfer darparwyr sy'n trosi JS fel diofyn (esm.sh): `false` yn caniatáu i'r darparwr gymhwyso ei draws-newid ESM arferol (angen i `import` bwynt mynediad pecyn go iawn). Yn ddiofyn yw `true` — gwasanaethu'r ffeil fel y mae, sydd yn ofynnol ar gyfer asedau wedi'u rhag-greu/nid-ESM fel taflenni CSS a phacedi IIFE."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A CDN that can serve npm package files. Providers never hardcode a package name — they only\nknow how to shape a URL from a [CdnFile](CdnFile.md)."
msgstr "CDN sy'n gallu gwasanaethu ffeiliau pecyn npm. Darparwyr byth yn codio enw pecyn yn uniongyrchol — maent ond yn gwybod sut i lunio URL o [CdnFile](CdnFile.md)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Stable identifier, e.g. `\"jsdelivr\"`."
msgstr "Adnabodwr sefydlog, er enghraifft `\"jsdelivr\"`."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Human-readable name, e.g. `\"jsDelivr\"`."
msgstr "Enw hawdd i'w ddarllen gan bobl, er enghraifft `\"jsDelivr\"`."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Whether [CdnProvider.buildCombineUrl](#buildcombineurl) is implemented."
msgstr "A yw [CdnProvider.buildCombineUrl](#buildcombineurl) wedi'i weithredu."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Builds the URL for a single file."
msgstr "Adeiladu'r URL ar gyfer ffeil sengl."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/CdnProvider.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Builds one URL that serves multiple files concatenated together. Required iff `supportsCombine`."
msgstr "Adeiladu un URL sy'n gwasanaethu sawl ffeil wedi'u gludo at ei gilydd. Angenrheidiol os ac ond os `supportsCombine`."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/interfaces/ThemeStrings.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The translatable strings baked into theme.css/theme.js's comments."
msgstr "Y llinellau testun i’w cyfieithu sydd wedi’u mewnosod yn sylwadau theme.css/theme.js."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/type-aliases/ThemeMode.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Rebrand token mode — ignored for the `canvas`/`canvasHighContrast` variants."
msgstr "Modd tocyn ail-frandio — yn cael ei hanwybyddu ar gyfer yr amrywiadau `canvas`/`canvasHighContrast`."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/type-aliases/ThemeVariant.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A pantoken token theme variant."
msgstr "Amrywiad thema token pantoken."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/variables/CDN_PROVIDERS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Providers available out of the box, keyed by [CdnProvider.id](../interfaces/CdnProvider.md#id)."
msgstr "Darparwyr sydd ar gael yn syth, wedi'u nodi gan [CdnProvider.id](../interfaces/CdnProvider.md#id)."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/variables/DEFAULT_CDN_PROVIDER_ID.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The provider used when none is specified."
msgstr "Y darparwr a ddefnyddir pan nad oes un wedi’i bennu."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/variables/DEFAULT_THEME_CSS_ASSETS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Component-style sheets, combined into theme.css's first `@import` where the provider allows it."
msgstr "Dalenni arddull cydrannau, wedi'u cyfuno i'r `@import` cyntaf o theme.css lle bo'r darparwr yn caniatáu hynny."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/variables/DEFAULT_THEME_FONT_ASSETS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Font sheet(s) — always loaded as their own `@import`(s), separate from the component styles."
msgstr "Taflen(ni) ffont — bob amser yn cael eu llwytho fel eu `@import`(s) eu hunain, ar wahân i steiliau'r cydran."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/variables/DEFAULT_THEME_JS_ASSETS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Script(s) theme.js injects via `<script>` tags."
msgstr "Script(s) theme.js injects via `&lt;script&gt;` tags."

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/variables/ENGLISH_THEME_STRINGS.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "English defaults, used for any key a caller's `strings` override doesn't supply."
msgstr "Diofynion Saesneg, a ddefnyddir ar gyfer unrhyw allwedd nad yw gosodiad `strings` y galwr yn ei ddarparu."

#: platforms/compose/src/functions/generateCompose.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Emit Compose Kotlin for a named theme. Returns the written file path."
msgstr "Allforio Compose Kotlin ar gyfer thema wedi'i enwi. Yn dychwelyd lwybr y ffeil a ysgrifenwyd."

#: platforms/compose/src/functions/toCompose.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Emit Compose Kotlin for an explicit token IR. Returns the written file path."
msgstr "Allanoli Compose Kotlin ar gyfer IR token esboniadol. Yn dychwelyd y llwybr i'r ffeil a ysgrifennwyd."

#: platforms/compose/src/functions/toCompose.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Dark mode with a custom object name**"
msgstr "**Modd tywyll gyda enw gwrthrych wedi'i deilwra**"

#: platforms/compose/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/compose` — emit Instructure design tokens as Jetpack Compose (Kotlin), via Style\nDictionary. It flattens the IR to concrete, single-mode values and keeps the natively-typed\ntokens (colours, dimensions, numbers)."
msgstr "`@pantoken/compose` — allforio tokenau dyluniad Instructure fel Jetpack Compose (Kotlin), drwy Style\nDictionary. Mae'n sythu'r IR i werthoedd concrid un‑modd ac yn cadw'r tokenau wedi'u teipio'n frodorol\n(lliwiau, dimensiynau, rhifau)."

#: platforms/compose/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [generateCompose](functions/generateCompose.md)"
msgstr "Ailenwi ac ailallforio [generateCompose](functions/generateCompose.md)"

#: platforms/compose/src/interfaces/GenerateComposeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [generateCompose](../functions/generateCompose.md) / [toCompose](../functions/toCompose.md)."
msgstr "Dewisiadau ar gyfer [generateCompose](../functions/generateCompose.md) / [toCompose](../functions/toCompose.md)."

#: platforms/compose/src/interfaces/GenerateComposeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The generated Kotlin object name (default `PanTokens`)."
msgstr "Enw'r gwrthrych Kotlin a gynhyrchwyd (diofyn `PanTokens`)."

#: platforms/drupal/src/functions/machineName.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Convert a display name to a Drupal machine name (`lower_snake`)."
msgstr "Trosi enw arddangos yn enw peiriant Drupal (`lower_snake`)."

#: platforms/drupal/src/functions/toDrupalTheme.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the files for a Drupal sub-theme that loads the Instructure tokens."
msgstr "Adeiladu'r ffeiliau ar gyfer is-destun Drupal sy'n llwytho tocynnau Instructure."

#: platforms/drupal/src/functions/toDrupalTheme.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The theme files, paths relative to the theme directory."
msgstr "Y ffeiliau thema, llwybrau yn gymharol i gyfeiriadur y thema."

#: platforms/drupal/src/functions/toDrupalTheme.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Build and write a standalone sub-theme**"
msgstr "**Adeiladu ac ysgrifennu is-destun annibynnol**"

#: platforms/drupal/src/functions/toDrupalTheme.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Build a sub-theme on top of a base theme**"
msgstr "**Adeiladu is-destun ar ben thema sylfaen**"

#: platforms/drupal/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/drupal` — emit an Instructure-themed Drupal sub-theme."
msgstr "`@pantoken/drupal` — creu is-destun Drupal ar thema Instructure."

#: platforms/drupal/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Produces the token stylesheet (from `@pantoken/css`) and an InstUI-look prose stylesheet (from\n`@pantoken/components`, styling content in a `.pantoken-prose` region), plus the `*.info.yml`\nand `*.libraries.yml` a Drupal 10/11 theme needs to load them. Drop the files into\n`themes/custom/<machine>/`."
msgstr "Produces the token stylesheet (from `@pantoken/css`) and an InstUI-look prose stylesheet (from\n`@pantoken/components`, styling content in a `.pantoken-prose` region), plus the `*.info.yml`\nand `*.libraries.yml` a Drupal 10/11 theme needs to load them. Drop the files into\n`themes/custom/&lt;machine&gt;/`."

#: platforms/drupal/src/interfaces/DrupalFile.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A generated file: a theme-relative path and its contents."
msgstr "Ffeil wedi'i chynhyrchu: llwybr perthynol i'r thema a'i gynnwys."

#: platforms/drupal/src/interfaces/ToDrupalThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [toDrupalTheme](../functions/toDrupalTheme.md)."
msgstr "Dewisiadau ar gyfer [toDrupalTheme](../functions/toDrupalTheme.md)."

#: platforms/drupal/src/interfaces/ToDrupalThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The theme's human-readable name (default `\"Instructure\"`)."
msgstr "Enw darllenadwy gan bobl y thema (rhagosodiad `\"Instructure\"`)."

#: platforms/drupal/src/interfaces/ToDrupalThemeOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The base theme (default `false` — a standalone theme)."
msgstr "Y thema sylfaen (rhagosodiad `false` — thema annibynnol)."

#: platforms/email/src/functions/emailTokens.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Select the token map for a mode (default `\"light\"`)."
msgstr "Dewiswch y map tocynnau ar gyfer modd (rhagosodedig `\"light\"`)."

#: platforms/email/src/functions/emailTokens.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Inline a token into an email cell (light mode)**"
msgstr "**Mewnosod tocyn yn linol i gell e-bost (modd golau)**"

#: platforms/email/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/email` — Instructure design tokens for HTML email."
msgstr "`@pantoken/email` — Tocynnau dylunio Instructure ar gyfer e-bost HTML."

#: platforms/email/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Email clients don't support CSS custom properties and often strip `<style>`, so tokens are fully\nresolved to concrete values for inline styling. Colours are hex; dimensions keep their `px` units.\nIcons are excluded. `light`/`dark` maps are keyed by camelCased token name."
msgstr "Email clients don't support CSS custom properties and often strip `&lt;style&gt;`, so tokens are fully\nresolved to concrete values for inline styling. Colours are hex; dimensions keep their `px` units.\nIcons are excluded. `light`/`dark` maps are keyed by camelCased token name."

#: platforms/email/src/variables/dark.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Concrete `dark`-mode token values."
msgstr "Gwerthoedd tocynnau `dark`-modd gonkretaidd."

#: platforms/email/src/variables/light.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
