#: renderers/foundation/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Foundation is Sass-first, so this package ships two layers. [toFoundationSettings](functions/toFoundationSettings.md) emits a\n`_settings`-style Sass partial that points Foundation's setting variables at `var(--instui-*)`, so\na Sass build compiles the Instructure look while keeping runtime theming through the same custom\nproperties. [toFoundationCss](functions/toFoundationCss.md) emits a thin CSS overlay that themes the common compiled\nclasses (`.button`, `.callout`, links) the same way — useful when you consume stock Foundation CSS\nand just want to layer Instructure colors on top without recompiling."
msgstr "Mae Foundation yn rhoi blaenoriaeth i Sass, felly mae’r pecyn hwn yn cyflwyno dwy haen. [toFoundationSettings](functions/toFoundationSettings.md) yn allyrru rhannol Sass ar steil `_settings` sy’n cyfeirio newidynnau gosodiadau Foundation at `var(--instui-*)`, felly mae adeilad Sass yn cyfansoddi ymddangosiad Instructure tra’n cadw themïau amser-rhedeg drwy’r un eiddo personol. [toFoundationCss](functions/toFoundationCss.md) yn allyrru haen CSS ysgafn sy’n thema’r dosbarthiadau cyffredin a gyfansoddwyd (`.button`, `.callout`, dolenni) yr un ffordd — defnyddiol pan ddefnyddiwch CSS Foundation stoc ac eisiau rhoi haen o liwiau Instructure uwchlaw heb ailgyfansoddi."

