msgid "**Compose a brand-icon plugin's resolver**"
msgstr "**Cyfansoddi datrysiwr ategyn brand-icon**"

#: renderers/markdown-it/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/markdown-it` — a markdown-it plugin that renders `:icon:` codes as inline SVG and\nstandalone color values (`#03893D`, `rgb(…)`, `oklch(…)`) as swatches, using the pantoken icon\nset."
msgstr "`@pantoken/markdown-it` — ategyn markdown-it sy'n rendro codau `:icon:` fel SVG mewnlinol a gwerthoedd lliw annibynnol (`#03893D`, `rgb(…)`, `oklch(…)`) fel samplau lliw, gan ddefnyddio set eicon pantoken."

#: renderers/markdown-it/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It ports the `@pantoken/rehype` and `@pantoken/react-markdown` pipelines onto markdown-it: a\nsingle core rule walks each inline token's text children, splits them on the icon and color\npatterns, and swaps the matches for `html_inline` tokens. Icon codes resolve through a chain —\nplugin `rehype` resolvers first, then an explicit [MarkdownItOptions.resolve](interfaces/MarkdownItOptions.md#resolve), then the\nbuilt-in `@pantoken/icons` set — so brand-icon plugins compose the same way they do elsewhere."
msgstr "Mae'n porthi'r pipeline `@pantoken/rehype` a `@pantoken/react-markdown` i markdown-it: mae un reol craidd yn cerdded trwy blant testun pob tocyn mewnlinol, yn eu rhannu ar batrymau eicon a lliw, ac yn cyfnewid y cydweddiadau am docynnau `html_inline`. Mae codau eicon yn cael eu datrys trwy gadwyn — datryswyr ategyn `rehype` yn gyntaf, yna [MarkdownItOptions.resolve](interfaces/MarkdownItOptions.md#resolve) penodol, yna'r set adeiledig `@pantoken/icons` — felly mae ategion brand-eicon yn cyfansoddi'r un ffordd ag y maent mewn mannau eraill."

#: renderers/markdown-it/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The emitted markup uses the same class names as the other renderers (`pantoken-icon`,\n`pantoken-color-swatch`), so loading `@pantoken/components` styles it. Wrap the rendered HTML in a\n`.pantoken-prose` container (see [PROSE\\_CLASS](variables/PROSE_CLASS.md)) to pick up the prose layer too."
msgstr "Mae'r marcŵp a allyrrir yn defnyddio'r un enwau dosbarth â'r rendradwyr eraill (`pantoken-icon`, `pantoken-color-swatch`), felly mae llwytho `@pantoken/components` yn ei steilio. Amgáu'r HTML a gafodd ei rendro mewn cynhwysydd `.pantoken-prose` (gweler [PROSE\\_CLASS](variables/PROSE_CLASS.md)) i gynnwys y haen prose hefyd."

#: renderers/markdown-it/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [pantokenMarkdownIt](functions/pantokenMarkdownIt.md)"
msgstr "Ailenwi ac ail-allforio [pantokenMarkdownIt](functions/pantokenMarkdownIt.md)"

