msgid "Add `!important` to component declarations so they beat Pendo's styles (default `true`)."
msgstr "Ychwanegu `!important` at ddatganiadau cydrannau fel y byddent yn curo steiliau Pendo (diofyn `true`)."

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Tree-shake unused `--instui-*` tokens (default `true`; off ships the full token set)."
msgstr "Pilio coeden i symud docennau `--instui-*` heb eu defnyddio (diofyn `true`; os caiff ei anablu, caiff y set token lawn ei gynnwys)."

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Convert `@property` at-rules to plain custom-property declarations via\n[flattenProperty](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/flattenProperty.md) (default `false`). `true` uses plugin defaults with\n`injectSelector: \":scope\"` so the declarations land inside the `@scope` block.\nPass a [FlattenPropertyOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md) object to override individual defaults."
msgstr "Trosi rheolau @`@property` i ddatganiadau sydd yn syml o briodoleddau arferiad trwy\n[flattenProperty](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/flattenProperty.md) (diofyn `false`). Mae `true` yn defnyddio diofynion y plugin gyda\n`injectSelector: \":scope\"` felly mae'r datganiadau yn cael eu gosod o fewn bloc `@scope`.\nPasio gwrthrych [FlattenPropertyOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md) i orfodi neu addasu'r diofynion unigol."

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mangle `--instui-*` names to minimal base-26 identifiers via [mangleCustomProps](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md)\n(default `false`). Safe here because the full token + component stylesheet is a\nself-contained bundle. Pass a [MangleCustomPropsOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md) object to override defaults."
msgstr "Cymysgu enwau `--instui-*` i adnabodwyr byr sylfaen-26 trwy [mangleCustomProps](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md)\n(diofyn `false`). Mae hyn yn ddiogel yma oherwydd bod y token llawn + taflen steil cydran yn becyn hunan-wedi'i gynnwys. Pasio gwrthrych [MangleCustomPropsOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md) i orfodi neu addasu'r diofynion."

#: renderers/pendo/src/variables/COMPONENTS.md
#, no-c-format
