#, no-c-format
#~ msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
#~ msgid "`.instui-progress-circle` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — A circular progress ring driven by `--value` and `--value-max` custom properties."
#~ msgstr "`.instui-progress-circle` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — Rêl cynnydd cylchol a yrrir gan briopertiau arferol `--value` a `--value-max`."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
#~ msgid "The ring is a `conic-gradient` donut painted on `::before` and clipped with a radial-gradient mask; `--value` divided by `--value-max` drives the arc. Add `-should-animate` and load the interactions entry point to animate it from zero on mount. InstUI has no indeterminate state; `:indeterminate` is a pantoken-only best guess (native `<progress>` without a `value` attribute), spinning the ring at a fixed arc and hiding `.value` since there's no meaningful number to show. `<meter>` has no indeterminate state, so it's unaffected."
#~ msgstr "Mae'r rêl yn dognwt `conic-gradient` wedi'i baentio ar `::before` a'i dorri gyda masg graddiant_radial; mae `--value` wedi'i rannu gan `--value-max` yn gyrru'r arc. Ychwanegwch `-should-animate` a llwythwch y pwynt mynediad rhyngweithio i'i animeiddio o sero wrth fwrn. Nid oes gan InstUI gyflwr anhysbys; mae `:indeterminate` yn dyfalu gorau ar gyfer pantoken yn unig (natif `<progress>` heb briodwedd `value`), yn troi'r rêl ar arc sefydlog ac yn cuddio `.value` gan nad oes rhif ystyrlon i'w ddangos. Nid oes gan `<meter>` gyflwr anhysbys, felly nid yw'n cael ei effeithio."

