#~ msgid "✅ Use Wrapper when:"
#~ msgstr "✅ Defnyddiwch Wrapper pan:"

#, no-c-format
#~ msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
#~ msgid "- Building a full Canvas product page that needs a consistent layout shell\n- The page uses GlobalNav as the primary navigation anchor\n- The page needs side panels: ContentTabList, TrailingContentArea, or a UtilityPanel\n- You need consistent container padding and content max-width across the full page\n🚫 Don't use Wrapper when:"
#~ msgstr "- Wrth adeiladu tudalen cynnyrch Canvas lawn sydd ei hangen modrwy cynllun cyson\n- Mae'r dudalen yn defnyddio GlobalNav fel y prif gês llywio\n- Mae'r dudalen angen phaneli ochr: ContentTabList, TrailingContentArea, neu UtilityPanel\n- Mae angen padio cynhwysydd cyson a led uchaf cynnwys cyson ar draws y dudalen gyfan\n🚫 Peidiwch ag defnyddio Wrapper pan:"

#, no-c-format
#~ msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
#~ msgid "- Building a Modal, Tray, or Drawer — those have their own layout containers\n- Wrapping a sub-section of a page — Wrapper contains the full page, not a region"
#~ msgstr "- Wrth adeiladu Modal, Tray, neu Drawer — mae gan y rhain eu cynwysyddion cynllun eu hunain\n- Wrapping o is-adran o dudalen — mae Wrapper yn cynnwys y dudalen gyfan, nid rhan"

#, no-c-format
#~ msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
#~ msgid "- Map the main content area to a &lt;main&gt; landmark with a skip-nav link so keyboard users can bypass GlobalNav\n- Give ContentTabList role=\"navigation\" with a distinct aria-label such as \"Page navigation\" — separate from GlobalNav's landmark\n- Give TrailingContentArea role=\"complementary\" with a descriptive aria-label that reflects its content, such as \"Student details\"\n- Give each UtilityPanel a distinct aria-label: \"AI assistant\", \"Notifications\", or \"Filters\"\n- When a UtilityPanel opens, move focus into the panel; when it closes, return focus to the trigger that opened it"
#~ msgstr "- Mapio'r ardal cynnwys prif i dirnod &lt;main&gt; gyda dolen skip-nav fel y gall defnyddwyr bysellfwrdd osgoi GlobalNav\n- Rhoddir ContentTabList role=\"navigation\" gydag aria-label wahanol megis \"Page navigation\" — ar wahân i dirnod GlobalNav\n- Rhoddir TrailingContentArea role=\"complementary\" gydag aria-label ddisgrifiadol sy'n adlewyrchu ei gynnwys, megis \"Student details\"\n- Rhoddir pob UtilityPanel aria-label wahanol: \"AI assistant\", \"Notifications\", neu \"Filters\"\n- Pan fydd UtilityPanel yn agor, symudwch ffocws i'r panel; pan fydd yn cau, dychgwch ffocws i'r sbardun a'i agorodd"

